{"annotations":{"readOnlyHint":false,"title":"Send email as your agent"},"description":"Send an email ATTRIBUTED TO THE AGENT (provenance-stamped). Unlike mAYL_send (sends as the user), this stamps sent_by='agent' plus your agent_id and optional task_id onto the email record and audit trail \u2014 so recipients and compliance can see the mail was agent-originated. Auth: presents a hub-claim JWT (needs MOSADD_API_KEY). The mp0st-send EF verifies the claim with HUB_JWT_SECRET; body trust is never granted for provenance.","execution":{"taskSupport":"forbidden"},"inputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","properties":{"agent_id":{"description":"Stable id of the agent doing the send. Stamped as sent_by_agent_id for provenance.","maxLength":120,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"bcc":{"items":{"format":"email","maxLength":254,"pattern":"^(?:[A-Za-z0-9_'+\\-]+\\.)*[A-Za-z0-9_'+\\-]*[A-Za-z0-9_+-]@(?:[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9\\-]*\\.)+[A-Za-z]{2,}$","type":"string"},"maxItems":50,"type":"array"},"body_html":{"maxLength":1048576,"type":"string"},"body_text":{"maxLength":1048576,"type":"string"},"cc":{"items":{"format":"email","maxLength":254,"pattern":"^(?:[A-Za-z0-9_'+\\-]+\\.)*[A-Za-z0-9_'+\\-]*[A-Za-z0-9_+-]@(?:[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9\\-]*\\.)+[A-Za-z]{2,}$","type":"string"},"maxItems":50,"type":"array"},"reply_to":{"format":"email","maxLength":254,"pattern":"^(?:[A-Za-z0-9_'+\\-]+\\.)*[A-Za-z0-9_'+\\-]*[A-Za-z0-9_+-]@(?:[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9\\-]*\\.)+[A-Za-z]{2,}$","type":"string"},"subject":{"maxLength":998,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"task_id":{"description":"Optional id of the task/run this send belongs to. Stamped as sent_by_task_id.","maxLength":120,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"to":{"anyOf":[{"format":"email","maxLength":254,"pattern":"^(?:[A-Za-z0-9_'+\\-]+\\.)*[A-Za-z0-9_'+\\-]*[A-Za-z0-9_+-]@(?:[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9\\-]*\\.)+[A-Za-z]{2,}$","type":"string"},{"items":{"format":"email","maxLength":254,"pattern":"^(?:[A-Za-z0-9_'+\\-]+\\.)*[A-Za-z0-9_'+\\-]*[A-Za-z0-9_+-]@(?:[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9\\-]*\\.)+[A-Za-z]{2,}$","type":"string"},"maxItems":50,"minItems":1,"type":"array"}]},"tracking":{"type":"boolean"}},"required":["to","subject","agent_id"],"type":"object"},"name":"mAYL_send_as_agent"}
